  - id: fw_pope
    text: 'Oh well, as far as I know the new pope Zephyrinus II. is located in Vatican
      City. Unless you mean pope Lando who lost his life in this area. His shipwreck
      is supposed to have been washed away, but his corpse was never found. Same
      goes for some artefacts '
    choices:
    - label: ' Where can I look for them?'
      nextNodeID: fw_help
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: Bye
      nextNodeID: 
      actionsOnChoose:
      - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e042ea431fc0410ab65ad4e53a6af14, type: 2}
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    actionsOnEnter: []
    wwiseEvent:
      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - id: fw_help
    text: How about I tell you about it if you help me to find my late husbands jewel.
      He died in the current of the strait right north of this jetty. I am old and
      can hardly catch winds. Would you be so kind to find the jewel that meant him
      a lot?
    choices:
    - label: I will help you
      nextNodeID: 
      actionsOnChoose:
      - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0df0114f505a6473298faef74a05572c, type: 2}
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: 'No '
